<section class="section-block">
	<h2>Limits of this design</h2>
	<ul>
		<li><strong>Every invoice has the same balance.</strong> A voiceml.org document can branch on the call but can&rsquo;t look anything up, so any invoice number gets $495.00. Looking up a real balance needs a server.</li>
		<li><strong>The invoice number doesn&rsquo;t reach Stripe.</strong> Values don&rsquo;t carry from one document to the next, so the payment document never sees the invoice number and its <code>description</code> is fixed text.</li>
		<li><strong>The closing message can&rsquo;t report the result.</strong> See above; reporting it needs a server as the <code>action</code>.</li>
		<li><strong>Keypad entry only.</strong> <code>&lt;Pay&gt;</code> takes card details as keypad digits; spoken card entry isn&rsquo;t available.</li>
		<li><strong>Written for test mode.</strong> Before taking real card payments, <a href="/contact/">talk to us</a>.</li>
	</ul>
</section>

